OL,3,APoland stabbings driven by online
OL,4,Aglorification of violence, Tusk says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree violent attacks at Polish schools
OL,7,Fthis week were driven by the
OL,8,F"glorification of violence" online,
OL,9,FPrime Minister Donald Tusk said.
OL,11,FThe attacks have left one woman dead
OL,12,Fand others injured, including children.
OL,14,F"These are very often spontaneous
OL,15,Factions inspired by online activity,"
OL,16,FTusk said on Sunday, during a crisis
OL,17,Fmeeting with security services.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
